@startuml
skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

title ROS 2 Publisher/Subscriber Node Graph

node "Gazebo Simulation" as Gazebo {
  [Ultrasound Probe Camera] as US_Cam
  [ros2_control Joint Interface] as JointCtrl
}

node "carotid_perception" as PerceptionNode {
  [Inference Engine]
}

node "carotid_motion_planner" as PlannerNode {
  [Target Pose Generator]
  [Inverse Kinematics Solver]
}

' Data flow / Topics
US_Cam --> PerceptionNode : **Topic:** /ultrasound/image_raw\n**Type:** sensor_msgs/Image
PerceptionNode --> PlannerNode : **Topic:** /carotid/target_point\n**Type:** geometry_msgs/PointStamped
PlannerNode --> JointCtrl : **Topic:** /joint_trajectory_controller/joint_trajectory\n**Type:** trajectory_msgs/JointTrajectory

@enduml
